  {
   "id": 350342,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Suppose you want to set up a computer network for a small business you are launching. The business will provide bookkeeping services for other businesses. You will maintain an office for yourself and one other employee. Your employees will also sometimes work remotely, either at their homes or at the clients’ locations. Do some research on the process of setting up a computer network for a small business. What types of equipment might you need? What types of security precautions should you take to protect your clients’ financial information?",
